<title>BELGIUM: Belgium details December OLO exchange auctions.</title>
<headline>Belgium details December OLO exchange auctions.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave following details for its upcoming OLO exchange auctions:</p>
<p>On December 3, OLOs expiring in January 1997 and August 1997 can be exchanged for OLOs expiring in July 1998, December 2000, June 2002 and October 2004.</p>
<p>On December 10, the OLO expiring in May 1997 can be exchanged against OLOs expiring in: April 1999, December 2000, June 2002, October 004 and May 2006.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810</p>
</text>
